    "No query-specific permeability, efflux, or transporter data are available; L4/L5 records are analog-based.",
    "The query condition is unspecified; many high-F contexts are fasted or cirrhosis, and pethidine normal F of about 0.48 is above threshold but not an exact condition match.",
    "Odanacatib and maraviroc F are dose-dependent, so quantitative transfer is uncertain."
  ],
  "decision_summary": "L6 hepatic clearance/metabolic-stability records are low-transferability analog data; the only records with linked F outcomes (haloperidol, meperidine) show extensive metabolism yet F above 20%, and no L6 record provides a direct sub-20% F. Combined with L1 gold F values all at/above threshold and L4/L5 mixed absorption/efflux evidence, the prediction remains high with moderate confidence."
}

